job='Make the difference between completing an operation and completing the intended task visible in one glance.',
edit='Keep the title, the UI/UX definitions, and the existing discussion question. Move the definitions into the left half. Place the illustration on the right; keep “A successful execution can still fail the task” as an editable line below it. No new slide.',
layout='Landscape 4:3 cutout, right half of the slide, approximately 40% of the usable area. Make the requested barrel and delivered crate large enough to distinguish from the back of the room.',
